---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Resources"
  description="Vegan and animal rights resources to help you learn, grow, and take action."
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="page-header__title">Resources</h1>
      <p class="page-header__subtitle">Learn, grow, and take action</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content-page">
    <h2>Ready to Start?</h2>
    <p>Choose a practical 7-day challenge or make one easy change with food swaps, Indian meal ideas, and support from a PAL Vegan Buddy.</p>
    <a href="/vegan-starter-kit/" class="btn btn--primary">Open the Vegan Starter Kit</a>

    <h2>Going Vegan</h2>
    <p>
      Veganism is the practice of abstaining from the use of animal products. It's one of the most
      effective ways to reduce your personal contribution to animal suffering.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <a href="https://greenfit.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>GreenFit</strong></a>
        — A free plant based nutrition guide and diet planning website for India
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.challenge22.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Challenge 22</strong></a>
        — A free 22-day vegan mentoring programme
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://veganuary.com/en-in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Veganuary</strong></a>
        — Try vegan for January with guides, meal plans, and support
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.peta.org/living/food/free-vegan-starter-kit/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>PETA's Vegan Starter Kit</strong></a>
        — A beginner's guide to going vegan
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Documentaries</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <a href="/videos/"><strong>3 Minute Movie Challenge</strong></a>
        — Watch our three-minute movie challenge in Hindi, English, and Marathi
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://animalequality.in/india-deadly-dairy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>The Deadly Dairy (2017)</strong></a>
        — Animal Equality India's undercover investigation into India's dairy industry
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.dominionmovement.com/watch" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Dominion (2018)</strong></a>
        — A comprehensive look at modern animal agriculture
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.nationearth.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Earthlings (2005)</strong></a>
        — A landmark documentary on human use of animals
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://gamechangersmovie.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>The Game Changers (2019)</strong></a>
        — Plant-based diets and athletic performance
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.cowspiracy.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Cowspiracy (2014)</strong></a>
        — Animal agriculture and the environment
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Books</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/29380.Animal_Liberation" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Animal Liberation</strong></a>
        by Peter Singer — The philosophical foundation of animal rights
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/295408.The_Case_for_Animal_Rights" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>The Case for Animal Rights</strong></a>
        by Tom Regan — Rights-based approach to animal ethics
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/6604712-eating-animals" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Eating Animals</strong></a>
        by Jonathan Safran Foer — A personal investigation of factory farming
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/7439389-why-we-love-dogs-eat-pigs-and-wear-cows" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Why We Love Dogs, Eat Pigs, and Wear Cows</strong></a>
        by Melanie Joy — Understanding carnism
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Activist Training</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.anonymousforthevoiceless.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Anonymous for the Voiceless</strong></a>
        — Street outreach methodology and training
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://thehumaneleague.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>The Humane League</strong></a>
        — Evidence-based advocacy research
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.vegansociety.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>The Vegan Society</strong></a>
        — Education and advocacy resources
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Questions?</h2>
    <p>If you need help or have questions about veganism or animal rights, we're here.</p>
    <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--primary">Contact Us</a>
  </div>
</Layout>
